{"name":"Monaco","slug":"monaco","code":"MC","continent":"Europe","hero":"plonkit/monaco/monaco.webp","updated":"2025-12-27T23:34:22.734Z","sections":[{"title":"Identifying Monaco","title_zh":"辨識摩納哥","items":[{"id":"1Jgd","text":["Monaco is a European **microstate** on the French Riviera, a few kilometres west of the border with Italy."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/monaco/Monaco_location.webp","link":"","clues":[],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"dU2m","text":["Monaco is a **rich** and **densely populated** city state, with a Mediterranean feel to it. The architecture is similar to cities in southern France and northern Italy, but more luxurious. You will see a lot of apartment buildings, neoclassical details, and pastel colours. There are essentially no rural areas."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/monaco/Monaco_Rich.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/uigMhSwBe6SnCU4MA","clues":["architecture"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"c3Rx","text":["Monaco’s licence plates are **short** and lack the blue strip.","You will still see a lot of normal French plates around, however. These French vehicles often still have the old yellow back plates, due to how old the Generation 2 coverage is."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/monaco/Monaco_Licence_Plate.webp","link":"","clues":["license_plates"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"W7d3","text":["Monaco is a **hilly** country. The very few areas that are not built up show mediterranean vegetation."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/monaco/Monaco_Hilly.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/3JveALZ5vX8AUkGH8","clues":["nature"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"3BaL","text":["Planted **palm trees** are common."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/monaco/Palm_trees.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/mUwP7PCGfzLuZaWs6","clues":["nature"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"6LyB","text":["There is a lot of coverage inside **tunnels**."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/monaco/Tunnels.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/E3Y9ws3uw87UwoEe7","clues":[],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"gJQj","text":["Rows of parked **mopeds** are a common sight around Monaco’s streets."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/monaco/Monaco_Mopeds.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/EhdAvrCRYS7czP3y7","clues":[],"important":false,"tagged":false}]},{"title":"Spotlight","title_zh":"重點地標","items":[{"id":"Dzdt","text":["In the harbour, there is an extensive **Generation 3 trekker on a boat**. The Google employee’s brown hair and sunglasses are visible. You can see Monaco’s skyline and the hills beyond it. There are a lot of expensive [yachts](https://goo.gl/maps/4Z8rnvc99PPCqQEL7) around.","This trekker shows up a lot in the official competitive game modes, so it is worth remembering."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/monaco/Harbour_trekker.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/v3st3FYK3yrp3wVc9","clues":["google_vehicles"],"important":false,"tagged":false}]}],"tip_count":8,"facts":{"driving_side":"right","phone_numbers":"+377","domains":[".mc"],"currencies":[{"name":"Euro","symbol":"€","status":"official","code":"EUR"}],"years":["2013","2014","2016","2017","2018","2019","2020","2021","2022","2023","2024","2025"],"lines":[["white"],["white"],["white"]]},"gallery":{"architecture":[{"image":"geohints/architecture/monaco_1.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/pCvd6JdyGhft662R6"}],"bollards":[{"image":"geohints/bollards/bollard_142.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/g2XQyxf1NW5GTuaV9"},{"image":"geohints/bollards/bollard_425.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/ARJAKiKMYBSrd1aK7"}],"companies":[{"image":"geohints/companies/companies_44.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/gXnPsoXvM4rkdGtT7"},{"image":"geohints/companies/companies_1177.svg","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/nRX5q9dM7CpiCPiE7"}],"flags":[{"image":"geohints/flags/flags_74.svg","link":""}],"google_vehicles":[{"image":"geohints/googleVehicles/boat_105.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/sttUWLUf8yKuM51UA"},{"image":"geohints/googleVehicles/car_951.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/RjVwNdYjR1MegSKB7"}],"license_plates":[{"image":"geohints/licensePlates/Monaco_front.webp","link":""}],"post_boxes":[{"image":"geohints/post_boxes/monaco_1.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/6wTcNNNrPYDFaDhh7"},{"image":"geohints/post_boxes/monaco_2.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/rUwpmThAYeSq3JTV8"},{"image":"geohints/post_boxes/monaco_3.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/bGbD6pUpEYmPw87u5"}],"scenery":[{"image":"geohints/sceneries/monaco_1.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/3cYqDmUtg32rux7k8"},{"image":"geohints/sceneries/monaco_2.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/vysqNRQYVfnAut846"},{"image":"geohints/sceneries/monaco_3.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/zuLC6ViaLauyZm5A7"}],"traffic_lights":[{"image":"geohints/trafficLights/light_29.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/EifGosT2pJ16G2RL8"},{"image":"geohints/trafficLights/light_136.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/u6Ka5biouP723UYQ9"}]},"key":"monaco"}